# Pagination ⭐⭐⭐⭐☆

Fetching 1 million records:

```java
findAll()
```

❌ Bad idea.

Instead,

fetch small chunks.

---

## Example

```java
Pageable pageable =

PageRequest.of(0, 20);

Page<Product> page =

repository.findAll(pageable);
```

Meaning

```
Page 0

20 Records
```

Much more efficient.

---

# Sorting

```java
Sort.by("price")
```

or

```java
Sort.by("name")

.ascending();
```

Combining both

```java
PageRequest.of(

0,

20,

Sort.by("price"));
```

