# Common Production Mistakes

### Returning Entity from Controller

Bad

```java
return product;
```

Prefer

```java
return ProductResponse;
```

---

### Using EAGER Everywhere

Causes unnecessary queries.

Prefer LAZY.

---

### Calling findAll()

Avoid loading huge tables.

Use pagination.

---

### Huge Transactions

Don't keep transactions open for too long.

Keep them short.

---

### Ignoring SQL Logs

Always enable SQL logs while debugging JPA issues.

It quickly reveals:

- N+1 queries
- Unexpected updates
- Missing indexes
- Performance problems

---

# Production Best Practices

✅ Use DTOs.

✅ Keep entities simple.

✅ Use `JpaRepository`.

✅ Prefer JPQL over Native SQL.

✅ Use Pagination.

✅ Keep transactions short.

✅ Default to LAZY fetching.

✅ Monitor generated SQL.

